<title>USA: FINOVA closes sale to Green Tree.</title>
<headline>FINOVA closes sale to Green Tree.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The FINOVA Group Inc said on Monday that it closed the previously announced sale of its manufacturer and dealer services business to Green Tree Financial Corp for about $620 million.</p>
<p>The business, which is involved in small-ticket leasing and financing products, was sold as part of an effort to concentrate on FINOVA's core commercial finance activities.</p>
</text>
